{"5232060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"GO DUB YOURSELF!","steam_appid":5232060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5301760],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dubbing is more fun with friends!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO DUB YOURSELF! is a party game where you and your friends take your favourite clips, select your lines and when the marker hits the line, you're on! Play it straight, go off-script, or just go crazy. You play your way, auto score, chat vote or even judging each other.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/0686900524ff70aeee0bf12adc2a66e8.poster.avif?t=1793725242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/0686900524ff70aeee0bf12adc2a66e8.webm?t=1793725242\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/0686900524ff70aeee0bf12adc2a66e8.mp4?t=1793725242\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE ANYTHING DUBBABLE<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in any video, any clip, any scene. In only a few clicks you can go from your favourite video into a fully dubbable pack in seconds to minutes: mark the lines, assign the characters, done. Exporting your packs is easy, including 1 click upload to the Steam Workshop, or even just export the packs directly to your PC.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY IT YOUR WAY<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op: up to 8 players on one machine, bring your friends!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online: up to 12 players online with built-in voice chat. Share a room code and go, no port forwarding!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party modes: You choose how you play, chat voting, player voting, pack party tournaments and many more options<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studio mode: For when you just want to make something without the fluff.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/633f373626f7c8635df1085555175966.poster.avif?t=1793725242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/633f373626f7c8635df1085555175966.webm?t=1793725242\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/633f373626f7c8635df1085555175966.mp4?t=1793725242\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dub over real movie scenes (that you have rights for)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clip Studio: turn any video into a clip pack<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop: browse, download and upload packs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert Choicer Voicer packs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op for up to 8 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online for up to 12 players, with voice chat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party modes and Pack Party tournaments<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studio mode for making videos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto, player and chat-vote scoring<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export and share your dubs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark mode<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice changer with 18 different choices<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO POOP YOURSELF! mode lets you mash up clips and make YTP's with your friends<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >plus much more to come...<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes footage from Cosmos Laundromat, (CC) Blender Foundation | , licensed CC BY 3.0. Cropped and shown in-game.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dubbing is more fun with friends!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO DUB YOURSELF! is a party game where you and your friends take your favourite clips, select your lines and when the marker hits the line, you're on! Play it straight, go off-script, or just go crazy. You play your way, auto score, chat vote or even judging each other.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/0686900524ff70aeee0bf12adc2a66e8.poster.avif?t=1793725242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/0686900524ff70aeee0bf12adc2a66e8.webm?t=1793725242\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/0686900524ff70aeee0bf12adc2a66e8.mp4?t=1793725242\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE ANYTHING DUBBABLE<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in any video, any clip, any scene. In only a few clicks you can go from your favourite video into a fully dubbable pack in seconds to minutes: mark the lines, assign the characters, done. Exporting your packs is easy, including 1 click upload to the Steam Workshop, or even just export the packs directly to your PC.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY IT YOUR WAY<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op: up to 8 players on one machine, bring your friends!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online: up to 12 players online with built-in voice chat. Share a room code and go, no port forwarding!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party modes: You choose how you play, chat voting, player voting, pack party tournaments and many more options<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studio mode: For when you just want to make something without the fluff.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/633f373626f7c8635df1085555175966.poster.avif?t=1793725242\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/633f373626f7c8635df1085555175966.webm?t=1793725242\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/extras\/633f373626f7c8635df1085555175966.mp4?t=1793725242\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dub over real movie scenes (that you have rights for)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clip Studio: turn any video into a clip pack<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop: browse, download and upload packs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert Choicer Voicer packs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op for up to 8 players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online for up to 12 players, with voice chat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party modes and Pack Party tournaments<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studio mode for making videos<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto, player and chat-vote scoring<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export and share your dubs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark mode<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice changer with 18 different choices<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO POOP YOURSELF! mode lets you mash up clips and make YTP's with your friends<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >plus much more to come...<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes footage from Cosmos Laundromat, (CC) Blender Foundation | , licensed CC BY 3.0. Cropped and shown in-game.<\/p>","short_description":"Grab a mic and dub over your favourite clips with your friends. Turn any video into a clip pack, share it on the workshop, then battle it out on the couch or online for up to 12 players. Auto score or judge each other, the choice is yours!","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/5117c5d1e2b0c4662cb4cfcf6583bc6546a2b32d\/header.jpg?t=1793725242","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/ab59b0336efbd08e31c2a94d6896b77ffecc21dc\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793725242","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232060\/ab59b0336efbd08e31c2a94d6896b77ffecc21dc\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793725242","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit, version 21H1 or newer)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD FX-8350<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 530 \/ AMD Radeon R5 or any DX10 \/ DX11 capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Minimums are speculative based on real world performance metrics, support can only be confirmed through user testing.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 \/ AMD Radeon RX 560 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Recommend requirements are speculative based on real world performance metrics, support can only be confirmed through user testing.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Nightcap Interactive"],"publishers":["Nightcap Interactive"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":519,"final":441,"discount_percent":15,"initial_formatted":"5,19€","final_formatted":"4,41€"},"packages":[1809847],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy GO DUB YOURSELF!","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1809847,"percent_savings_text":"-15% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"GO DUB YOURSELF! - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">5,19€<\/span> 4,41€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":